  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7081401",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Tiantian",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708140301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708140301": {
            "id": "708140301",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "A—Are you an adventurer? Are you here to accept commissions?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140302"
            ]
          },
          "708140302": {
            "id": "708140302",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "Uh, please... wait a moment, let me see what I have here... \"Speed Glider,\" \"Outdoor Survival Experience Guide,\" \"Free Climbing Instructor Wanted...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140303"
            ]
          },
          "708140303": {
            "id": "708140303",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "That doesn't sound like the Adventurers' Guild...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140304"
            ]
          },
          "708140304": {
            "id": "708140304",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "I know, and Lan says so too! But all the adventures I've read about in books were something like this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140305"
            ]
          },
          "708140305": {
            "id": "708140305",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "If I don't give out these commissions, what should I give out, then...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140306"
            ]
          },
          "708140306": {
            "id": "708140306",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Something like \"beat up monsters,\" perhaps?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140307"
            ]
          },
          "708140307": {
            "id": "708140307",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "I—Isn't that dangerous? I mean, there are a lot of them around Lisha, and they are a threat to passers-by.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140308"
            ]
          },
          "708140308": {
            "id": "708140308",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "But normal people don't stand a chance against them. They might even get hurt...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140310",
              "708140312"
            ]
          },
          "708140310": {
            "id": "708140310",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "Can you really? Well.. Alright then, I'll leave it in your hands. I'll go back and discuss appropriate payment for your services with Lan."
          },
          "708140312": {
            "id": "708140312",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "Is that so... W—Well then, I'll let you handle it. I'll discuss your payment with Lan later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7081402",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat all opponents and clear the obstacles",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708140201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708140201": {
            "id": "708140201",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Was there anything else?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140202"
            ]
          },
          "708140202": {
            "id": "708140202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Have you found that sword of yours?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140203"
            ]
          },
          "708140203": {
            "id": "708140203",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "...Huh, to think you still remember that. Unfortunately, no. I still don't have the foggiest idea where it might be.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140204"
            ]
          },
          "708140204": {
            "id": "708140204",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "It seems I'm still at square one, waiting for things to happen.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140205"
            ]
          },
          "708140205": {
            "id": "708140205",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "If anything related to that matter crops up, I might come looking for you — When that happens, I'll be counting on you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7081403",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Tiantian",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708140501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708140501": {
            "id": "708140501",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "Eh? You're back already? Have you completed the commission?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140502"
            ]
          },
          "708140502": {
            "id": "708140502",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Done, and done!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140503"
            ]
          },
          "708140503": {
            "id": "708140503",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "That's... really impressive. I went back to the Guild to reorganize our commissions based on the one I gave you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140504"
            ]
          },
          "708140504": {
            "id": "708140504",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "There was a whole mountain of commissions related to defeating monsters. So adventurers are supposed to do this sort of thing all the time...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140505"
            ]
          },
          "708140505": {
            "id": "708140505",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "But other than monsters, there've been reports that say that Treasure Hoarders have been seen along the roads.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140506"
            ]
          },
          "708140506": {
            "id": "708140506",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "Is this really also something the Adventurers' Guild should do? It feels like it falls under the job scope of the Millelith...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140508",
              "708140510"
            ]
          },
          "708140508": {
            "id": "708140508",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "Huh. Adventurers can really do anything, it seems.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140511"
            ]
          },
          "708140511": {
            "id": "708140511",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "Well then, I will prepare adequate compensation for you — so please take this commission, too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140512"
            ]
          },
          "708140512": {
            "id": "708140512",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What, another one already? We haven't gotten our...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140513"
            ]
          },
          "708140513": {
            "id": "708140513",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "There'll be further compensation! I've already discussed this with Lan. So as long as you complete the next commission, you'll receive further payment.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140514"
            ]
          },
          "708140514": {
            "id": "708140514",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Well, that sounds more like it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140515"
            ]
          },
          "708140515": {
            "id": "708140515",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "I'll be counting on you, then.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140516"
            ]
          },
          "708140516": {
            "id": "708140516",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "Well, that's two commissions down.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140517"
            ]
          },
          "708140517": {
            "id": "708140517",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "The secret method Lan taught me to \"get adventurers to take commissions gladly\" really works..."
          },
          "708140510": {
            "id": "708140510",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "Adventurers really are impressive... It seems like you can do almost anything."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7081404",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat the Treasure Hoarders in Lisha",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708140401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708140401": {
            "id": "708140401",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "Do all adventurers do these dangerous things?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140402"
            ]
          },
          "708140402": {
            "id": "708140402",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "But what if they get injured..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7081405",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Tiantian",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708140701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708140701": {
            "id": "708140701",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "Have you finished the commissions?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140702"
            ]
          },
          "708140702": {
            "id": "708140702",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You bet I have.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140703"
            ]
          },
          "708140703": {
            "id": "708140703",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "Wow... So this is the strength of an adventurer.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140704"
            ]
          },
          "708140704": {
            "id": "708140704",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "Well, um, if you don't mind, could you answer some of my questions about adventurers and commissions?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140705"
            ]
          },
          "708140705": {
            "id": "708140705",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "Other than defeating monsters, what other commissions do adventurers take?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140709"
            ]
          },
          "708140709": {
            "id": "708140709",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "Whoa, doesn't that just mean that you adventurers do everything? I never knew.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140710"
            ]
          },
          "708140710": {
            "id": "708140710",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "Thank you! I'll make note of it for sure... Ah yes, right. This is your repayment, please take it. It's as generous as can be, you know!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140711"
            ]
          },
          "708140711": {
            "id": "708140711",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "Next time you're here to take commissions from me, I'll make sure to give you the best ones!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7081406",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708140601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708140601": {
            "id": "708140601",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "I'll leave it to you then, adventurer!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708140602"
            ]
          },
          "708140602": {
            "id": "708140602",
            "speakerId": 2096,
            "speakerName": "Tiantian",
            "text": "The secret method Lan taught me to \"get adventurers to take commissions gladly\" really works..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}